    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Introducing 44 Dromore, a bright and well presented two-bedroom, two-bathroom semi-detached house within close proximity of Cootehill town. The property consists of a welcoming entrance hallway with access to an open plan kitchen / dining / living room. The generous fully equipped kitchen includes convenient access to the rear. The ground floor is completed with a spacious guest bathroom. Upstairs is a spacious double bedroom and further generous single bedroom. The property is completed with a further family bathroom. An ideal opportunity for first time buyers and investors. \r\n\r\nMore about the location…\r\nSituated in Dromore on the outskirts of Cootehill Town, number 44 is a short commute to major employers including Abbott and Manor Farm, while Cavan Town is just short commute further afield. There are several local schools, along with beautiful Erica’s Fairy Forest and Dartry Park. A host of sports facilities from a gym to GAA grounds and soccer facilities are nearby."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\n\r\nHallway – 2.56m x 3.20m\r\nWelcoming entrance hallway with wooden flooring and carpeted stairs. \r\n\r\nKitchen – 3.71 x 2.47m\r\nSpacious open plan living area with a fully equipped kitchen and access to the rear. \r\n\r\nLiving room – 3.71 x 3.07m\r\nSpacious and welcoming living room.\r\n\r\nGuest Bathroom – 2.01m x 2.07m \r\nLarge guest bathroom including WC and wash hand basin. \r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nMain Bedroom – 3.07m x 3.90m\r\nBright and generously sized double bedroom. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 – 2.56m x 2.74m\r\nGenerous single bedroom. \r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom – 1.12m x 3.07m\r\nFully equipped bathroom including bath / shower, wash hand basin and WC."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Oil fired central heating\r\nIdeally located on the outskirts of Cootehill town\r\nIdeal opportunity for first time buyers and investors\r\nTurnkey condition\r\nRecently decorated"
      },
